{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--capacity-planner","name":"capacity-planner","description":"Use when an ops leader (Director of CX, Head of Support, VP Ops, Head of BizOps, Head of IT ops, Head of Finance ops) is sizing ops capacity, building a headcount plan, modeling utilization risk, planning Q3 capacity or annual support capacity, or designing CS coverage — and needs Erlang-C queueing math, P90 demand sizing, shrinkage-adjusted FTE, manager-trigger thresholds, and a quarterly hiring sequence with ramp + attrition. Apply when sustained team utilization is above 80% or when the team is growing >50% in 12 months. Run before committing the headcount budget. This is NOT engineering capacity (see vpe-advisor for DORA + cycle time) and NOT strategic 3-year workforce planning (see chro-advisor).","category":"Product & business","tags":["capacity","planner","when","ops","leader","director","cx","head","support","vp","bizops","it","finance","is","sizing","building","headcount","plan"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"business-operations/skills/capacity-planner","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/business-operations/skills/capacity-planner","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":9,"bytes":78328,"sha256":"436f8c3586c577ca28aa05136b49c2687d8bd3bf058e49de3a173b8004968a7a","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"business-operations/skills/capacity-planner/SKILL.md","bytes":12133,"sha256":"436f8c3586c577ca28aa05136b49c2687d8bd3bf058e49de3a173b8004968a7a","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/business-operations/skills/capacity-planner/SKILL.md"},{"p